OL,3,AUS and Iran trade strikes for first
OL,4,Atime in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran said it had struck US military
OL,7,Fbases in Jordan in response, with
OL,8,FJordan's army saying it had intercepted
OL,9,Feight missiles early on Monday morning.
